OL,3,GNEWSA'People don't think recycling at
OL,4,Awork is part of their job description'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere was still "lots of room for
OL,7,Fimprovement" when it comes to how much
OL,8,Fwe recycle at work compared with our
OL,9,Fhabits at home, according to an expert.
OL,11,FFigures suggest only 61% of people in
OL,12,FWales recycle often at their workplace,
OL,13,Fwith one in five saying they do not
OL,14,Frecall seeing the appropriate
OL,15,Ffacilities to do so.
OL,17,FProviding more bins or clearer
OL,18,Flabelling are some of the ways in which
OL,19,Fbusinesses could make a difference,
OL,20,Fsaid waste reduction charity Wrap.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
