OL,3,GNEWSA'People don't think recycling at
OL,4,Awork is part of their job description'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut one business had already seen a
OL,7,F"significant improvement" at their
OL,8,Foffices after removing staff's personal
OL,9,Fbins, a move that was initially met
OL,10,Fwith resistance.
